OL,3,GNEWSAIrish police 'acted appropriately'
OL,4,Awhen pursuing car in M9 crash, watchdog
OL,5,Afinds
OL,6,
OL,7,FIrish police "acted appropriately"
OL,8,Fduring its pursuit of a car which
OL,9,Fcrashed on the wrong side of the road
OL,10,Fin the Republic of Ireland last month,
OL,11,Fthe police watchdog has found.
OL,13,FFive teenage boys died in the head-on
OL,14,Fcollision on the M9 and four family
OL,15,Fmembers were seriously injured in the
OL,16,Fcrash on 16 August.
OL,18,FThe police ombudsman Fiosru said Gardai
OL,19,F(Irish police) had been following the
OL,20,Fcar on the N78 in Athy for a short
OL,21,Fperiod before it joined the M9 motorway
OL,22,Fagainst the direction of traffic.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
