OL,3,GNEWSAIrish police 'acted appropriately'
OL,4,Awhen pursuing car in M9 crash, watchdog
OL,5,Afinds
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice Ombudsman Emily Logan said the
OL,8,Fforce acted "in line with relevant
OL,9,Fpolicies and procedures as determined
OL,10,Fby the Garda Commissioner".
